  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: I saw a group of Exciter riders outside. I think they were racing to see
      who could reach the shop first.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Did any of them win?
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: They all lost to the pothole down the street. It was hilarious! I almost
      gave them a free drink just for the entertainment.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Man, I wish I was there to see that.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: "Next time I'll record it for you. It\u2019s better than Netflix!"
    Choices: []
